  "sections": [
    {
      "sectionId": "section-introduction",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "sourceAnchor": "introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Rebuke feat lets you knock an enemy Prone when you deal Radiant damage to them, similar to the Warlock’s Eldritch Smite invocation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Knocking a foe Prone without a save is great, but once per rest simply isn’t enough to justify this feat unless you have some other ability that requires an enemy to be Poisoned."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-ability-score-increase",
      "heading": "Ability Score Increase",
      "sourceAnchor": "ability-score-increase",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-ability-score-increase-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Anything!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-radiant-strike",
      "heading": "Radiant Strike",
      "sourceAnchor": "radiant-strike",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-radiant-strike-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Auto-prone an enemy once per rest when you hit them with Radiant damage. Divine Smite, Sacred Flame, True Strike, whatever."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-radiant-strike-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Of course, you could also use a Topple weapon, but that does allow a save."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
